WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.996 --> 00:00:05.879
Mazatl and his father had traded all their corn.

2
00:00:06.199 --> 00:00:13.004
In return, they received their family needed.

3
00:00:13.024 --> 00:00:13.584
The market was closing.

4
00:00:13.604 --> 00:00:16.046
Most sellers were quickly wrapping up their blankets.

5
00:00:31.708 --> 00:00:32.929
“What’s going on?”

6
00:00:33.609 --> 00:00:34.370
Mandy asked.

7
00:00:34.390 --> 00:00:36.891
“Mazatl, where’s Vinnie?”

8
00:00:36.911 --> 00:00:41.654
“The priests will make an offering to our gods,” replied Mazatl.

9
00:00:41.674 --> 00:00:43.855
“Follow me to the temple.

10
00:00:44.716 --> 00:00:46.097
I’m sure Vinnie will be there.”

11
00:00:48.958 --> 00:00:52.000
Vinnie heard the drums beating faster and faster.

12
00:00:53.341 --> 00:00:56.202
He turned and saw a parade leaving the ball court.

13
00:00:57.363 --> 00:00:58.444
The game was over.

14
00:00:59.772 --> 00:01:02.354
Men in animal costumes danced around.

15
00:01:04.036 --> 00:01:05.477
Some pretended to fight.

16
00:01:06.498 --> 00:01:08.820
Other people sang and chanted loudly.

17
00:01:09.781 --> 00:01:11.443
People were playing flutes too.

18
00:01:12.564 --> 00:01:15.086
Vinnie thought it was a victory celebration.

19
00:01:15.106 --> 00:01:16.667
“Who won?”

20
00:01:17.208 --> 00:01:18.349
he asked a young boy.

21
00:01:18.369 --> 00:01:20.270
“Who cares?”

22
00:01:20.911 --> 00:01:21.752
replied the boy.

23
00:01:21.772 --> 00:01:24.054
“All the players are prisoners.

24
00:01:24.754 --> 00:01:26.376
Today the losers will die.

25
00:01:27.200 --> 00:01:30.661
But all the prisoners will be given to the gods someday soon.”

26
00:01:31.681 --> 00:01:34.342
The crowd was now heading toward the pyramid.

27
00:01:34.362 --> 00:01:40.284
“What? The losing team is going to die?”

28
00:01:41.184 --> 00:01:42.084
gasped Vinnie.

29
00:01:42.104 --> 00:01:46.585
“Their blood will be given to the gods,” said the young boy.

30
00:01:46.605 --> 00:01:51.306
“In return, the gods will give us good weather for our crops.”

31
00:01:52.307 --> 00:01:53.847
Vinnie could not believe it!

32
00:01:54.667 --> 00:01:56.668
He watched the players who had lost.

33
00:01:57.728 --> 00:02:01.971
Tied together, the group was being pushed forward by the temple guards.

34
00:02:02.952 --> 00:02:05.773
Vinnie didn’t want to see what was about to happen.

35
00:02:06.714 --> 00:02:08.635
But the crowd shoved him up front.

36
00:02:08.655 --> 00:02:12.478
“Mandy! Mazatl!”

37
00:02:12.958 --> 00:02:14.940
he shouted as loud as he could.

38
00:02:15.980 --> 00:02:18.382
But the drums continued to beat louder.

39
00:02:19.863 --> 00:02:21.024
No one could hear him.

40
00:02:21.944 --> 00:02:24.106
Mandy followed Mazatl to the temple.

41
00:02:24.126 --> 00:02:27.128
“It’s amazing!”

42
00:02:28.148 --> 00:02:30.710
she remarked when she saw the tall pyramid.

43
00:02:31.910 --> 00:02:34.812
She asked Mazatl about the two buildings on the top.

44
00:02:34.832 --> 00:02:38.954
“Those are where the sacrifices are held,” he explained.

45
00:02:38.974 --> 00:02:42.556
“Why are these people being killed?”

46
00:02:43.317 --> 00:02:44.457
she asked carefully.

47
00:02:44.477 --> 00:02:49.320
“Today is a festival to honor our gods,” said Mazatl.

48
00:02:50.081 --> 00:02:51.261
Mandy understood.

49
00:02:52.182 --> 00:02:55.664
To Mazatl, the gods controlled the lives of his family.

50
00:02:56.520 --> 00:02:58.822
Sacrifice was important to the gods.

51
00:02:59.923 --> 00:03:03.686
So people had to die for the future well-being of the Aztecs.

52
00:03:06.709 --> 00:03:08.951
“Mazatl, do you see Vinnie?

53
00:03:10.272 --> 00:03:11.954
Oh, where is he?”

54
00:03:12.674 --> 00:03:13.255
she cried.

55
00:03:13.275 --> 00:03:15.076
“I don’t see him.

56
00:03:15.637 --> 00:03:19.560
He must be trapped in the crowd somewhere,” replied Mazatl.

57
00:03:20.681 --> 00:03:22.122
Mandy yelled for Vinnie.

58
00:03:23.243 --> 00:03:26.637
Worried, she ran as fast as she could toward the temple.

59
00:03:27.897 --> 00:03:31.378
Meanwhile, Vinnie managed to break away from the crowd.

60
00:03:31.398 --> 00:03:35.359
“Whew! I can breathe!”

61
00:03:35.919 --> 00:03:38.000
he said, wiping his forehead.

62
00:03:39.080 --> 00:03:42.241
A single line of men moved slowly in front of him.

63
00:03:43.381 --> 00:03:45.282
Vinnie felt someone push him hard.

64
00:03:45.302 --> 00:03:48.583
“Hey!” Vinnie turned angrily.

65
00:03:50.583 --> 00:03:54.746
The person pushing him held a spear— it was a temple guard!

66
00:03:56.208 --> 00:03:58.851
Only then did Vinnie realize where he was.

67
00:03:59.572 --> 00:04:01.794
He was in the line to be sacrificed.

68
00:04:02.715 --> 00:04:03.957
He tried to explain.

69
00:04:03.977 --> 00:04:06.240
“There’s been a mistake!”

70
00:04:07.301 --> 00:04:09.684
But the guard only pushed him forward again.
